## 6. SCHEDULED MEMORY PRUNING (ANTI-CONTENT-ROT)
Integrate Antigravity Scheduled Tasks (Cron: 0 0 * * *) via Agent 15 (Memory Keeper). The system automatically compresses daily work into context_snapshot.md inside folder 3 nightly, clearing stale prompt memory to eliminate content rot and context drift.

