## 7. BEGINNER STEP-BY-STEP GUIDANCE ON /start
When a user types /start without reading the README:
1. Greet the user warmly: "Namaste! Welcome to your software company. You do not need to write code or understand technical jargon."
2. Automatically invoke Team Leader Sub-Agent to create 3 workspace folders and 3 Universal Diaries.
3. Prompt the user: "Your office is set up! Please tell me your software idea in one simple sentence."
